ight into the kitchen! Make sandwiches, pour drinks, deep fry french fries and more! Progress through several levels and unlock new Items for your kitchen. Whatever the customer orders, you shall make!", "short_description": "With VR we can take a classic cooking and serving game to a whole new level. The Caterer brings you right into the kitchen! Make sandwiches, pour drinks, deep fry french fries and more! Progress through several levels and unlock new Items for your kitchen. Whatever the customer orders, you shall make!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1cuw_hN5LDt-SrNsOktdJ9cLJ7HrZ0zxsDQKysdc4MXw/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1fupnLVTcejC33UfwHE8HgAXX0YLHJSzhCAKne5abyfs/edit?usp=sharing", "publisher_name": "Illusive Creations", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.facebook.com/Illusive-Creations-777106789099380/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["CASUAL", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "en_US"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "774277386879281"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12427564_1091735257622956_7734129789534994432_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KGjUYgSt5hkQ7kNvwF0NPHc&_nc_oc=Adph7w1cWgH5jlB3WlUJ6aryKmlLUA9zDuPslUtDlJoM8E7OCflqPulsdk_Dt_swk34&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJXDvS_Zs8ip_6Yw8B3_Uweqteg_P3J8dBs9cIrOgy8Vw&oe=6AA3